# Said once, at install: on every upgrade it would be noise.
post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
Omawhite is in the app launcher. `omawhite` opens the most recent board,
`omawhite --new` a new one.

The rest is opt-in, for each person who wants it:

  The bar widget, on the Omarchy shell
    mkdir -p ~/.config/omarchy/plugins
    ln -s /usr/share/omawhite/plugin ~/.config/omarchy/plugins/edu.omawhite
    omarchy plugin enable edu.omawhite right

  A theme change reaching a board left open on another monitor
    omarchy hook install theme-set /usr/share/omawhite/omarchy/omawhite
    omarchy hook install font-set /usr/share/omawhite/omarchy/omawhite

  The skill that lets the agents here read and add frames
    /usr/share/omawhite/skills/omawhite/install.sh

Boards live in ~/.local/share/omawhite, and removing the package leaves
them there.
EOF
}
